+#. Hades: value of setting "videoscreen.hades3doutput": as Automatic, but a half 3D layout keeps the lines of a 2160p mode where the display takes it only at 1080p; translated in Estuary (#54952)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62873"
+msgid "Automatic, keep 2160p"
+msgstr ""
